      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "1. Test TCP SYN flood attacks with varying packet sizes against the dynamic blacklist.\n2. Test UDP flood scenarios exceeding the 10ms rate limit window.\n3. Verify rule-based filtering blocks unauthorized port requests for TCP and UDP protocols.\n4. Validate anomaly detection triggers when packet sizes exceed defined irregularity thresholds.\n5. Confirm rate limiting drops packets for IPs exceeding the limit within the 10ms window.\n6. Test simultaneous TCP and UDP header inspection against the dynamic blacklist.\n7. Verify rule-based filtering blocks unauthorized port requests for TCP and UDP protocols.\n8. Validate anomaly detection triggers when packet sizes exceed defined irregularity thresholds.\n9. Confirm rate limiting drops packets for IPs exceeding the limit within the 10ms window.\n10. Test TCP SYN flood attacks with varying packet sizes against the dynamic blacklist.\n11. Test UDP flood scenarios exceeding the 10ms rate limit window.\n12. Verify rule-based filtering blocks unauthorized port requests for TCP and UDP protocols.\n13. Validate anomaly detection triggers when packet sizes exceed defined irregularity thresholds.\n14. Confirm rate limiting drops packets for IPs exceeding the limit within the 10ms window.",
